# Belt and braces for this tracker specifically. The repository root already ignores
# bin/, obj/, appsettings.Development.json and .cache/, so this file only covers what
# those patterns miss.

# The on-disk response cache. Its default home is under LocalApplicationData and never
# the working tree (HaloDiskCacheHandler.DefaultDirectory enforces that), but
# Halo:CacheDirectory is a supported setting and pointing it at a relative path is an
# easy thing to do while debugging. What lands there is recorded API responses: a named
# player's full match history, keyed by XUID. The root's `.cache/` and
# `trackers/**/cache/` patterns do not match either of these names.
halo-cache/
eet-trackers/

# Local configuration, repeated here so it is ignored wherever in this tracker it is put
# rather than only next to Program.cs.
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.*.Local.json
appsettings.*.local.json
